{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01J1rFiQRZbe2CtCpvYFP6Bk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I wrote **`answers/05-002-how-evaluate-a-chatbot.md`** — the three-layer chatbot evaluation framework:\n\n- **Layer 1 — Offline/golden-dataset**: RAGAS metrics (Faithfulness, Answer Relevancy, Context Recall, Context Precision) + Task Success Rate for task-completion bots; gates every deploy at Faithfulness ≥ 0.85.\n- **Layer 2 — LLM-judge sampling**: GPT-4o/GPT-4o-mini scoring 3–5% of live traffic for helpfulness, groundedness, conversation coherence, and clarification rate.\n- **Layer 3 — Production business metrics**: Deflection rate (primary ROI), CSAT, escalation rate, p95 latency, cost per query.\n- **Deployment gate pipeline**: offline → shadow (LLM judge on 5% traffic) → canary (10% / 48h) → full rollout.\n- **Key pitfalls covered**: CSAT-only eval (selection bias), BLEU/ROUGE for conversational output (n-gram overlap is meaningless here), and single-number composite metrics that hide which layer is failing."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":385,"cache_read_input_tokens":66037,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":385,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4955f7bc-9cb6-468a-8f0c-d5759c1b9c71","uuid":"27222086-5de2-4fc5-ad7b-fbdb769eb737"}
